    "original_public_Lean_names": "Namespace and declaration spellings are preserved; extraction wrappers use the original namespace. No public alias or replacement judgment is introduced.",
    "complete_public_judgment": "All three selected Correct/FPEquiv/Contract sources are byte-identical to the before snapshot/current selected pins. Proofs helper non-import bytes are unchanged. Existing full-judgment equivalence, execution, safety, output/frame, domain/coverage and mathematical connection proofs remain in Proofs and compile against the same definitions now owned by IO.",
    "exceptions": [
      "Four AlgorithmSource.projection proof fields explicitly unfold the matching unchanged Typed*.fp32Original in their existing simp only lists. Removing exactly these four proof-only arguments recovers the original RealIO block bytes. The source-data fixture proves by rfl that kernel fields and all proof-irrelevant AlgorithmSource structures equal their original data specification."
    ]
